//cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a668959c2898f80caf7e29_arrow%20(1).svg" alt=""/></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div data-w-id="6a1ddc62-a420-8577-8c7e-04b9670fffdc" className="section-lookbook-transition-wrapper"><section className="section-lookbook-transition"><div className="w-layout-blockcontainer container-lookbook-transition w-container"><div className="lookbook-transition"><div className="lookbook-text-block-button"><div className="lookbook-text-block"><p data-w-id="1abdc81a-64fb-abfa-bb38-d24ec4a7174c" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="lookbook-b-m _2">Haus continues to define the space between architectural intent and human motion, leaving a permanent imprint on the modern grid.</p><p data-w-id="1abdc81a-64fb-abfa-bb38-d24ec4a7174e" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="lookbook-b-m _2">This sequence is merely the foundation for what follows.</p></div><div data-w-id="1abdc81a-64fb-abfa-bb38-d24ec4a71750" style={{"Webkittransform":"translate3d(0, 80%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)","Moztransform":"translate3d(0, 80%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)","mstransform":"translate3d(0, 80%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)","transform":"translate3d(0, 80%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)","opacity":"0"}} className="lookbook-button v2"><a data-w-id="d7c74e45-cb79-6ef4-73b9-42e93def867a" href="https://webflow.com/templates/designers/8amdesign" className="primary-button w-inline-block"><div className="primary-button-wrapper"><div className="button-b-l">[</div></div><div className="primary-button-text-anim"><div data-w-id="d7c74e45-cb79-6ef4-73b9-42e93def867f" className="button-b-l">explore the archive</div><div data-w-id="d7c74e45-cb79-6ef4-73b9-42e93def8681" className="button-b-l">explore the archive</div></div><div className="primary-button-wrapper"><div className="button-b-l">]</div></div></a></div></div></div></div></section></div><section id="About" className="section-about"><div data-w-id="13ec7340-20b5-ed5c-4bdb-265256b1fbca" className="skachable-wrapper"><div className="skachable _5"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6987b393f6ccd55665fdd_Image-9.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 631px) 100vw, 631px" srcSet="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6987b393f6ccd55665fdd_Image-9-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6987b393f6ccd55665fdd_Image-9.png 631w" alt="Person with platinum blonde short hair wearing a black dress and boots, sitting on a carpeted floor holding black paper leaves."/></div><div className="skachable _4"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6987b746935b692626139_Image-8.png" loading="lazy" alt="Person wearing oversized black leather jacket and matching pencil skirt with sunglasses against a plain background."/></div><div className="skachable _3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6987bd394b4c3b826ec3f_Image-7.png" loading="lazy" alt="Person with short silver hair wearing an oversized black puffer jacket, black shorts, thigh-high black socks, and black combat boots standing against a plain light background."/></div><div className="skachable _2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6987a7a1fa0f08215b3de_Image-6.png" loading="lazy" alt="Young woman with long white hair wearing a loose lavender sweatshirt and light gray cargo pants."/></div><div className="skachable"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a6989d433dc437768351c4_lookbook.png" loading="lazy" alt="Smiling woman wearing an oversized rust-colored sweater and wide-leg brown pants with black shoes against a white background."/></div></div><div className="w-layout-blockcontainer container-about w-container"><div className="about-content-wrapper"><div className="about-text-block-wrapper"><div className="about-text-block"><p data-w-id="e58aac2b-e077-b107-c476-cdb5d8faca9b" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="about-b-m">Haus exists at the intersection of garment and object. We reject the cycle of seasonal trends in favor of permanent relevance. Every piece is a result of rigorous pattern-making and high-grade sourcing—designed for those who view fashion as adeliberate expression of identity.</p></div><div className="about-text-block"><p data-w-id="6fc44459-1f63-757d-e3f4-445c6cc9fdaa" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="about-b-m">Haus exists at the intersection of garment and object. We reject the cycle of seasonal trends in favor of permanent relevance. Every piece is a result of rigorous pattern-making and high-grade sourcing designed for those who view fashion as a deliberate expression of identity. Our practice is rooted in the belief that clothing should be as enduring as the structures we inhabit. By focusing on monochromatic depth and structural integrity, we create a uniform for the modern multidisciplinary thinker. the grid dictates the flow of every textile choice we make.</p><p data-w-id="6fc44459-1f63-757d-e3f4-445c6cc9fdac" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="about-b-m _2">We are not just making clothes; we are defining a new visual language for the digital and physical realm.</p></div></div><div className="about-content-bottom"><div className="about-content-bottom-left"><div className="about-b-m content-bottom">Season fall26</div><div className="about-content-bottom-title"><h2 data-w-id="5483bbda-cdea-f7ae-a248-561962108983" style={{"Webkittransform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","Moztransform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","mstransform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","transform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","opacity":"0.05"}} className="about-d-s mobile">Intention</h2></div><div className="about-content-bottom-title"><div className="about-b-m content-bottom-v2">We are all in.</div><div className="about-title-wrapper"><h2 data-w-id="7020fd37-d619-4bce-3308-2fbe88a29dcf" style={{"Webkittransform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","Moztransform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","mstransform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","transform":"translate3d(0, 115%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(7deg) skew(0, 0)","opacity":"0.05"}} className="about-d-s">ON Wear</h2></div></div></div><div className="about-content-bottom-right"><div className="about-b-l max-width">Chapter 0.001</div><div className="about-b-l max-width">INDEX 2/2</div></div></div></div></div></section><div id="Stockists" data-w-id="c052f531-dd02-7222-0eca-009a0600cbcc" className="section-stockists-wrapper"><section className="section-stockists"><div className="w-layout-blockcontainer container-stockists w-container"><div className="stockists-content-wrapper"><div className="stockists-content-left"><div data-w-id="fe7839b3-9d74-0155-379b-9602b2612c00" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="stockists-b-m max-width _2nd">Our stockists are selected through a curated process</div><div data-w-id="c71c75cf-b326-ecc3-56f8-2608fce27744" style={{"opacity":"0"}} className="stockists-b-m _2nd">Prioritizing alignment with our design philosophy, material standards, and cultural positioning.</div></div><div className="stockists-content-right"><div data-w-id="d231e4ff-6257-2be1-2a45-412786f1bb33" className="stockists-item-wrapper _1"><div className="stockists-item hide"><div className="stockists-origin"><div className="stockists-b-l padding">PARIS, FR</div><div className="stockists-origin-number _1"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a52ab53f7184dd97bc0cd6_Vector%20(3).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" className="stockists-vector"/></div></div><div className="stockists-item-text-block"><div className="stockists-b-m">Concept Boutiques and Independent Fashion.</div><div className="stockists-item-caption"><div className="stockists-caption">Paris serves as a primary reference point for contemporary fashion discourse. Our presence in the city is anchored through concept boutiques and independent retailers that emphasize editorial curation, craftsmanship, and experimental design.</div><div className="stockists-caption">These partners provide a refined environment where the collection is contextualized within broader narratives of fashion, art, and cultural production.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="16b05cce-abb5-b0fc-0470-79c233a828d6" className="stockists-item-wrapper _2"><div className="stockists-item hide"><div className="stockists-origin"><div className="stockists-b-l padding">TOKYO, JP</div><div className="stockists-origin-number _2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a52ab5f89fed9c7469c849_Vector%20(2).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" className="stockists-vector"/></div></div><div className="stockists-item-text-block"><div className="stockists-b-m">Avant-Garde Retail and Cultural Concept Stores</div><div className="stockists-item-caption"><div className="stockists-caption">Tokyo represents a convergence of innovation, subculture, and precision. Our stockists in the city operate at the intersection of fashion, design, and technology, presenting the collection within spaces that prioritize experimentation and forward-thinking aesthetics.</div><div className="stockists-caption">These partners provide a refined environment where the collection is contextualized within broader narratives of fashion, art, and cultural production.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="f15104cb-1aa2-4ed1-9bf7-96c0a238f6bd" className="stockists-item-wrapper _3"><div className="stockists-item hide"><div className="stockists-origin"><div className="stockists-b-l padding">BERLIN, DE</div><div className="stockists-origin-number _3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a52ab5376132fecf437011_Vector%20(1).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" className="stockists-vector"/></div></div><div className="stockists-item-text-block"><div className="stockists-b-m">Concept Boutiques and Independent Fashion.</div><div className="stockists-item-caption"><div className="stockists-caption">Paris serves as a primary reference point for contemporary fashion discourse. Our presence in the city is anchored through concept boutiques and independent retailers that emphasize editorial curation, craftsmanship, and experimental design.</div><div className="stockists-caption">These partners provide a refined environment where the collection is contextualized within broader narratives of fashion, art, and cultural production.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="d231e4ff-6257-2be1-2a45-412786f1bb42" className="stockists-item-wrapper"><div className="stockists-item hide"><div className="stockists-origin"><div className="stockists-b-l padding">NEW YORK, US</div><div className="stockists-origin-number"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a52ab52c0fac8a26538b11_Vector.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" className="stockists-vector"/></div></div><div className="stockists-item-text-block"><div className="stockists-b-m">Global Flagship Partners and Multi-Brand Boutiques</div><div className="stockists-item-caption"><div className="stockists-caption">New York functions as a global commercial and cultural hub. Our stockists range from flagship multi-brand retailers to specialized boutiques that prioritize editorial storytelling and spatial experience.</div><div className="stockists-caption">These locations bridge global audiences with the collection, situating it within a dynamic context of fashion, art, and urban culture.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-w-id="f8cfc686-4ce2-1c0b-9c66-4430f5cf5b72" className="section-cta-wrapper"><section className="section-cta"><div className="w-layout-blockcontainer container-cta w-container"><div className="cta-content-wrapper"><div className="cta-indicator-button"><div className="cta-b-m hide">Dialogue</div><div className="cta-button-wrapper"><div data-w-id="fb011e84-a597-e6ae-96b6-c440d7abbc22" className="cta-button"><a data-w-id="d7c74e45-cb79-6ef4-73b9-42e93def867a" href="https://webflow.com/templates/designers/8amdesign" className="primary-button w-inline-block"><div className="primary-button-wrapper"><div className="button-b-l">[</div></div><div className="primary-button-text-anim"><div data-w-id="d7c74e45-cb79-6ef4-73b9-42e93def867f" className="button-b-l">contact studio</div><div data-w-id="d7c74e45-cb79-6ef4-73b9-42e93def8681" className="button-b-l">contact studio</div></div><div className="primary-button-wrapper"><div className="button-b-l">]</div></div></a></div></div></div><div className="cta-text-block-wrapper"><div className="cta-text-block"><p data-w-id="f8cfc686-4ce2-1c0b-9c66-4430f5cf5b7c" className="cta-b-m">For showroom appointments, collection previews, or collaborative inquiries, please reach out to our studio.</p></div><div className="cta-text-block left hide"><p data-w-id="f8cfc686-4ce2-1c0b-9c66-4430f5cf5b7f" className="cta-b-m">Connect with our studio to schedule a private viewing, explore the new collection, or discuss creative synergies</p></div></div><div className="cta-main-content"><div className="cta-image"><img sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" srcSet="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69a534548740066b6a855a83_Image%20(2)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a3b779dc496975c0b73f42/69